{
  "info": {
    "name": "Ecommerce Storefront API",
    "description": "Headless storefront APIs under `/api/v1/store`. Requires `x-publishable-key`.\n\n## Setup\n1. Import this collection + `Store-A` (Alora) or `Store-B` (Zentrix) environment.\n2. After `npm run db:seed`, create a **new publishable key** in Platform Admin (or Create Store) and paste `data.rawKey` / `data.keys.publishableKey` into `publishable_key`.\n3. **List Keys only returns a prefix** (e.g. `pk_live_00161409…`) — that is not enough for this header.\n4. Put only the raw key: `pk_live_` + hex, one line, no quotes/JSON/newline.\n\nThe collection pre-request script sanitizes `publishable_key` if you accidentally paste junk.\n\n## Suggested smoke order\n1. Store → Details / List Products / Get Product By Handle (auto-sets `variant_id`, `media_id`, `product_handle`)\n2. Cart → Create Cart → Add Item → Set Cart Email → Set Shipping Address → Checkout\n3. Customer Auth → Register or Login → Me / My Orders\n4. Addresses CRUD (needs customer token)\n5. Wishlist → Add / List / Remove (needs customer token + `variant_id`)\n6. Request Return only works when the order status is **DELIVERED** (admin marks delivered first)\n\nSeed examples (Zentrix): product `ivory-soft-cotton-romper`, category `baby-boys`, collection `featured`.\nDiscount `SAVE10` is not seeded — create it in Store Admin first (`PERCENTAGE` / 10).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "function sanitizePublishableKey(raw) {",
          "  if (raw === undefined || raw === null) return raw;",
          "  let value = String(raw).replace(/[\\r\\n\\t]/g, '').trim();",
          "  value = value.replace(/^[\"']|[\"']$/g, '');",
          "  const match = value.match(/pk_live_[0-9a-fA-F]+/);",
          "  return match ? match[0] : value;",
          "}",
          "const envKey = pm.environment.get('publishable_key');",
          "const colKey = pm.collectionVariables.get('publishable_key');",
          "if (envKey) pm.environment.set('publishable_key', sanitizePublishableKey(envKey));",
          "if (colKey) pm.collectionVariables.set('publishable_key', sanitizePublishableKey(colKey));",
          "const header = pm.request.headers.get('x-publishable-key');",
          "if (header && !String(header).includes('{{')) {",
          "  pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'x-publishable-key', value: sanitizePublishableKey(header) });",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:8787/api/v1" },
    { "key": "publishable_key", "value": "pk_live_REPLACE_ME" },
    { "key": "product_handle", "value": "ivory-soft-cotton-romper" },
    { "key": "category_slug", "value": "baby-boys" },
    { "key": "collection_slug", "value": "featured" },
    { "key": "search_q", "value": "romper" },
    { "key": "cart_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "item_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "variant_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "media_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "customer_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "address_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "wishlist_item_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "order_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "order_number", "value": "" },
    { "key": "discount_code", "value": "SAVE10" },
    { "key": "customer_email", "value": "customer@example.com" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Store",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Details",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/details",
            "description": "Public store profile + shipping/tax settings resolved from the publishable key."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List Products",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const items = json?.data || [];",
                  "if (items[0]?.handle) pm.collectionVariables.set('product_handle', items[0].handle);",
                  "if (items[0]?.thumbnail?.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('media_id', items[0].thumbnail.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/store/products?page=1&pageSize=20&sort=created_at_desc",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["store", "products"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "pageSize", "value": "20" },
                { "key": "sort", "value": "created_at_desc", "description": "created_at_desc | price_asc | price_desc" },
                { "key": "q", "value": "{{search_q}}", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "categoryId", "value": "", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "collectionId", "value": "", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "inStock", "value": "true", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "minPricePaise", "value": "0", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "maxPricePaise", "value": "", "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Each product includes `thumbnail { id, altText, src }`, `minPricePaise`, `maxPricePaise`, `inStock`. Load image at `GET {{base_url}}{{thumbnail.src}}` (same as Get Media)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Search Products",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/store/products?page=1&pageSize=20&q={{search_q}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["store", "products"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "pageSize", "value": "20" },
                { "key": "q", "value": "{{search_q}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Same list endpoint with `q` search."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Product By Handle",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const data = json?.data;",
                  "if (data?.handle) pm.collectionVariables.set('product_handle', data.handle);",
                  "const variant = (data?.variants || []).find((v) => v.inStock) || (data?.variants || [])[0];",
                  "if (variant?.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('variant_id', variant.id);",
                  "const media = data?.thumbnail?.id || data?.images?.[0]?.id;",
                  "if (media) pm.collectionVariables.set('media_id', media);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/products/{{product_handle}}",
            "description": "Returns variants (with `availableQuantity` / `inStock`), `images[]`, and `thumbnail`. Zentrix seed default handle: `ivory-soft-cotton-romper`. Auto-saves `variant_id` and `media_id`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List Categories",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const items = json?.data || [];",
                  "const preferred = items.find((c) => c.slug === 'baby-boys') || items[0];",
                  "if (preferred?.slug) pm.collectionVariables.set('category_slug', preferred.slug);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/categories"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Category",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/categories/{{category_slug}}",
            "description": "Category + nested products with thumbnails. Zentrix examples: `baby-boys`, `baby-girls`, `newborn-clothing`, `party-occasion-wear`, `baby-costumes`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List Collections",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const items = json?.data || [];",
                  "if (items[0]?.slug) pm.collectionVariables.set('collection_slug', items[0].slug);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/collections"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Collection",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/collections/{{collection_slug}}",
            "description": "Seed collection slug is usually `featured`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Media",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/media/{{media_id}}",
            "description": "Returns **raw image bytes** (not JSON). Set `media_id` from List/Get Product thumbnail or images."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Cart",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Cart",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json?.data?.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('cart_id', json.data.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customer_token}}", "disabled": true }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/carts",
            "description": "Optional customer JWT attaches the cart to the logged-in customer on create."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Cart",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/carts/{{cart_id}}",
            "description": "Includes estimated `taxTotalPaise`, `shippingTotalPaise`, `grandTotalPaise`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Attach Customer",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customer_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/carts/{{cart_id}}/customer"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Add Item",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const items = json?.data?.items || [];",
                  "const match = items.find((i) => i.variantId === pm.collectionVariables.get('variant_id')) || items[0];",
                  "if (match?.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('item_id', match.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"variantId\": \"{{variant_id}}\",\n  \"quantity\": 1\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/carts/{{cart_id}}/items",
            "description": "Run Get Product By Handle first so `variant_id` is set. Stock is checked server-side."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Item",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"quantity\": 2\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/carts/{{cart_id}}/items/{{item_id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Remove Item",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/carts/{{cart_id}}/items/{{item_id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Apply Discount",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"{{discount_code}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/carts/{{cart_id}}/discount",
            "description": "Code must exist and be ACTIVE for this store. Create via Store Admin (`PERCENTAGE` or `FIXED_PAISE`). Not seeded by default."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Clear Discount",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": null\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/carts/{{cart_id}}/discount"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Set Shipping Address",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Customer Name\",\n  \"phone\": \"9999999999\",\n  \"addressLine1\": \"12 MG Road\",\n  \"city\": \"Bengaluru\",\n  \"state\": \"KA\",\n  \"postalCode\": \"560001\",\n  \"country\": \"IN\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/carts/{{cart_id}}/shipping-address"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Apply Saved Address",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customer_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"addressId\": \"{{address_id}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/carts/{{cart_id}}/shipping-address/from-saved"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Set Cart Email",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{customer_email}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/carts/{{cart_id}}/email",
            "description": "Required before checkout unless you pass `email` in the checkout body or the cart already has a customer email."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Checkout",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json?.data?.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('order_id', json.data.id);",
                  "if (json?.data?.orderNumber) pm.collectionVariables.set('order_number', json.data.orderNumber);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customer_token}}", "disabled": true },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "checkout-{{$guid}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{customer_email}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/carts/{{cart_id}}/checkout",
            "description": "Requires items + shipping address + email. Optional: enable customer JWT to attach the order to the customer. Optional body fields: `discountCode`, `email`. Money is integer paise."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Customer Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json?.data?.accessToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('customer_token', json.data.accessToken);",
                  "if (json?.data?.customer?.email) pm.collectionVariables.set('customer_email', json.data.customer.email);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{customer_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"Customer@123\",\n  \"name\": \"Test Customer\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/auth/register",
            "description": "Use a unique email per run if the address already exists."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json?.data?.accessToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('customer_token', json.data.accessToken);",
                  "if (json?.data?.customer?.email) pm.collectionVariables.set('customer_email', json.data.customer.email);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{customer_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"Customer@123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/auth/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customer_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/auth/me"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Orders",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "My Orders",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customer_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/orders"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Lookup Order",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json?.data?.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('order_id', json.data.id);",
                  "if (json?.data?.orderNumber) pm.collectionVariables.set('order_number', json.data.orderNumber);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/store/orders/lookup?orderNumber={{order_number}}&email={{customer_email}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["store", "orders", "lookup"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "orderNumber", "value": "{{order_number}}" },
                { "key": "email", "value": "{{customer_email}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Guest order lookup by order number + email. No customer JWT required."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get My Order",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customer_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/orders/{{order_id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Request Return",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customer_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"Item does not fit as expected\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/orders/{{order_id}}/return",
            "description": "Only for **DELIVERED** orders owned by the customer. Creates a `REQUESTED` return. Restock happens after Store Admin approval. Returns 422 if status is still PENDING/SHIPPED."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Addresses",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Addresses",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customer_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/addresses"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Address",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json?.data?.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('address_id', json.data.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customer_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Test Customer\",\n  \"phone\": \"9999999999\",\n  \"addressLine1\": \"12 MG Road\",\n  \"city\": \"Bengaluru\",\n  \"state\": \"KA\",\n  \"postalCode\": \"560001\",\n  \"country\": \"IN\",\n  \"isDefault\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/addresses"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Address",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customer_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"addressLine1\": \"14 MG Road\",\n  \"isDefault\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/addresses/{{address_id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Address",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customer_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/addresses/{{address_id}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Wishlist",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Wishlist",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customer_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/wishlist",
            "description": "Returns wishlist items with nested variant + product summary. Newest first."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Add To Wishlist",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json?.data?.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('wishlist_item_id', json.data.id);",
                  "if (json?.data?.variantId) pm.collectionVariables.set('variant_id', json.data.variantId);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customer_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"variantId\": \"{{variant_id}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/wishlist",
            "description": "Adds an ACTIVE store variant. Duplicate adds are idempotent (returns existing row)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Remove Wishlist Item",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customer_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/wishlist/{{wishlist_item_id}}",
            "description": "Remove by wishlist item id."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Remove Wishlist By Variant",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-publishable-key", "value": "{{publishable_key}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customer_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/store/wishlist/variants/{{variant_id}}",
            "description": "Remove by variant id (useful for heart toggles)."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
